abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for an admissible cargo-capacity completion bound
  specialized to exact Fixed-Permutation Splitting and Charging Problem
  (FPSCP) decoding with FP-FLA, including source-matched benchmarks,
  synthetic stress validation, and direct-upstream compatibility checks.
